WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:16.920
Bobby opened the door to the gym.

2
00:00:16.921 --> 00:00:22.002
Jason, Nina, and Izzie were there already, ready for Kids Central.

3
00:00:22.003 --> 00:00:28.288
Miss Shelly was passing out sweatbands.

4
00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:32.745
"What are we doing today, Miss Shelly?" Bobby asked.

5
00:00:32.746 --> 00:00:38.802
"We are exercising," Miss Shelly answered.

6
00:00:38.803 --> 00:00:43.667
"Are we playing basketball?" Bobby asked excitedly.

7
00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:48.212
"We're doing a different kind of exercise," she said.

8
00:00:48.213 --> 00:00:52.047
"Today we'll exercise our brains!"

9
00:00:52.048 --> 00:00:54.730
The kids looked at each other.

10
00:00:54.731 --> 00:01:01.121
"Our brains? Does that mean we're doing math?" Nina asked, frowning.

11
00:01:01.122 --> 00:01:04.732
Bobby groaned.

12
00:01:04.733 --> 00:01:09.677
"Not quite. I have a bucket here full of brain teasers."

13
00:01:09.678 --> 00:01:13.578
Miss Shelly held up a bucket of cards.

14
00:01:13.579 --> 00:01:16.859
"Here, Nina," Miss Shelly said.

15
00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:20.636
"Pick a card and read the brain teaser to yourself.

16
00:01:20.637 --> 00:01:24.003
Then choose someone to answer it."

17
00:01:24.004 --> 00:01:27.387
Nina took a card and read it silently.

18
00:01:27.388 --> 00:01:29.695
Then she grinned.

19
00:01:29.696 --> 00:01:33.811
"I choose Bobby," she said.

20
00:01:33.812 --> 00:01:39.354
"How many letters are in the alphabet?" Nina asked.

21
00:01:39.355 --> 00:01:44.216
"That's easy. 26," Bobby answered.

22
00:01:44.217 --> 00:01:48.668
Nina burst into giggles.

23
00:01:48.669 --> 00:01:59.799
"Nope. 11! T-h-e-a-l-p-h-a-b-e-t.

24
00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.218
Get it? That's 11!"

25
00:02:02.219 --> 00:02:04.752
She smiled at Miss Shelly.

26
00:02:04.753 --> 00:02:07.392
"This is fun."

27
00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:09.604
"Okay, Bobby, you're next.

28
00:02:09.605 --> 00:02:12.862
Pick a card," Miss Shelly said.

29
00:02:12.863 --> 00:02:16.270
Bobby took a card and read it.

30
00:02:16.271 --> 00:02:20.745
"Jason!" he said, turning to his friend.

31
00:02:20.746 --> 00:02:25.159
"What goes up but never comes down?"

32
00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:30.712
Jason shrugged. "A hot air balloon? Clouds?"

33
00:02:30.713 --> 00:02:35.479
"You can only have one answer!" Bobby said.

34
00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.358
"Okay, clouds."

35
00:02:38.359 --> 00:02:45.514
"Nope. Your age!" Bobby waved the card in front of Jason.

36
00:02:45.515 --> 00:02:49.968
"My turn," Jason said, taking a card out of the bucket.

37
00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:55.062
"Aha! This is a good one." He turned to Izzie.

38
00:02:55.063 --> 00:02:59.742
"What doesn't get any wetter, even in the rain?"

39
00:02:59.743 --> 00:03:02.204
Izzie thought for a moment.

40
00:03:02.205 --> 00:03:05.612
"An umbrella?" she guessed.

41
00:03:05.613 --> 00:03:11.480
"No. Water!" Jason said happily.

42
00:03:11.481 --> 00:03:14.252
"Okay. Here I go.

43
00:03:14.253 --> 00:03:20.298
Nina, what is full of holes but still holds water?" Izzie asked.

44
00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:26.218
"There's a hole in the bucket . . . ," Nina began to sing softly.

45
00:03:26.219 --> 00:03:29.623
"A basket!" she cried.

46
00:03:29.624 --> 00:03:31.798
"No, but good try!

47
00:03:31.799 --> 00:03:36.993
The answer is a sponge," Izzie told her friend.

48
00:03:36.994 --> 00:03:41.874
"Miss Shelly, now it's your turn!" Jason said.

49
00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:43.910
"Okay. Here I go."

50
00:03:43.911 --> 00:03:49.420
Miss Shelly took a card, closed her eyes, and spun around in a circle.

51
00:03:49.421 --> 00:03:53.287
When she stopped, she was facing Bobby.

52
00:03:53.288 --> 00:03:56.441
"Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

53
00:03:56.442 --> 00:04:01.097
"The more of them you take, the more you leave behind.

54
00:04:01.098 --> 00:04:03.380
What are they?"

55
00:04:03.381 --> 00:04:07.156
Bobby thought.

56
00:04:07.157 --> 00:04:14.635
"The more of them you take, the more you leave behind," he repeated to himself.

57
00:04:14.636 --> 00:04:24.474
"I take showers . . . I take naps . . . I take steps . . . Steps! Footsteps!

58
00:04:24.475 --> 00:04:28.570
That's the answer, Miss Shelly," Bobby said.

59
00:04:28.571 --> 00:04:33.346
Miss Shelly clapped her hands and laughed.

60
00:04:33.347 --> 00:04:38.334
"Well done!" she said. "You got it."

61
00:04:38.335 --> 00:04:45.603
"These were hard brain teasers," Nina said. "My head hurts!"

62
00:04:45.604 --> 00:04:51.567
"Miss Shelly, can I take home the brain-teaser bucket?" Bobby asked.

63
00:04:51.568 --> 00:04:59.996
"I'm going to learn every brain teaser in the world!"
